    fiber_spline_generator: join fiber splines that meet at a shared end point (#2434)
    
    * fiber_spline_generator: join splines that meet at a shared end point
    
    The catalogue only proposed gap joins between end points 0.25 to 30 voxels
    apart, so two halves of a chain split by fit_portions, which keep the cut
    vertex, were never joined, while the same pieces half a voxel apart were.
    Below 0.25 voxels the join direction now comes from the end-point tangent.
    
    * Reject backward spline bridges and apply angle cleanup to coincident joins
    
    ---------
    
    Co-authored-by: villa-review[bot] <339717352+villa-review[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>

